            <title>[IGNITE-26770] Incorrect mvn commands and files handling in PdsCompatibility tests on Windows</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26770</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Running compatibility tests locally involves executing maven commands to download artifacts and do other operations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This logic is contained in MavenUtils class but it doesn&apos;t handle Windows specifics properly.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is needed to fix these issues and have PdsCompatibility tests running on Windows as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
